# Package registries agents commonly need to install dependencies.
# Read access for npm, PyPI, Go modules and crates. These hosts also accept
# uploads (npm publish, twine): a credential inside the project could be
# used to publish; see docs/agents.md, "Limits".
registry.npmjs.org
pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org
proxy.golang.org
sum.golang.org
index.crates.io
static.crates.io
crates.io
